Team,

Heads up on the Ledger Core v1 API deprecation timeline:

- Aug 15, 2026: v1 write endpoints move to read-only.
- Sep 30, 2026: v1 endpoints return 410 Gone. All consumers must be on v2.

Payments has already migrated to v2. If your capability still calls
POST /ledger/v1/entries, switch to POST /ledger/v2/journal-entries.
The v2 API requires an idempotency key header on all writes.

Migration guide: https://devportal.example.com/docs/ledger-v2-migration
Questions: #ledger-core

Thanks,
Alex Chen
